        "tab_TPkht9": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is this for?",
            "content": "<p>Ideal for individuals seeking to address signs of aging, such as fine lines and wrinkles around the eyes and lips. Suitable for both beginners and those experienced with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/pages\/how-microcurrent-facial-therapy-works\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/pages\/how-microcurrent-facial-therapy-works\">microcurrent therapy<\/a>. Not recommended for individuals who have a history of skin reactions to adhesives. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_ddakF6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is included?",
            "content": "<ul><li>1 x Conductive Eye Mask<\/li><li>1 x Conductive Lip Mask<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "66232a31-cb5f-4a67-97cf-d0377bb2fac6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Cleanse Skin<\/strong>: Ensure the eye and lip areas are clean and free from oils or makeup.<\/li><li><strong>Apply Conductive Serum<\/strong>: Lightly spritz the areas with 7E Wellness Replenish Spritzer or apply a water-based serum. Avoid oil-based products.<\/li><li><strong>Peel Backing<\/strong>: Carefully peel the plastic backing from each mask.<\/li><li><strong>Position Masks<\/strong>: Place the eye mask over the eye area and the lip mask over the lips, ensuring proper contact with the skin.<\/li><li><strong>Connect to Device<\/strong>: Attach the masks to your MyoLift™ device using the provided lead wire splitters.<\/li><li><strong>Select Settings<\/strong>: Use the Educate or Erase setting on your device, adjusting the frequency as needed.<\/li><li><strong>Treatment Duration<\/strong>: Apply for 10–30 minutes, dividing the time between the Educate and Erase settings.<\/li><\/ol><p><strong>Post-Treatment Care<\/strong>: Remove the masks, clean any residue, and store them in a sealed bag for future use.<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Reduces Fine Lines and Wrinkles<\/strong>: Targets aging signs around the eyes and lips.<\/li><li><strong>Stimulates Collagen and Elastin Production<\/strong>: Enhances skin elasticity and firmness.<\/li><li><strong>Improves Skin Tone and Texture<\/strong>: Promotes a smoother and more youthful complexion.<\/li><li><strong>Convenient and Easy to Use<\/strong>: Ideal for at-home treatments.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Cost-Effective<\/strong>: Reusable design offers multiple treatments per mask<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
